# Print reliability (remember)

## Goal
Kitchen + online order + receipt prints reach: **almost never miss · sometimes duplicate one ticket · never silent-lose a whole day.**

## Core rule
Hold until **“printed”** as far as we can know → when printer is **ready again** (incl. after new paper) → **auto-retry failed / unconfirmed jobs for that printer only** — not all open orders.

## Phase 0 — product rules (LOCKED)

| Rule | Locked value |
|--|--|
| Scope | **Kitchen** · **Online/web** kitchen (+ receipt if used) · **Customer receipt** |
| Hosts | **Mother** owns printers/queue; **Client** still prints via Mother only |
| Success | Best signal printer can give (ready / job OK / not paper-out). If unknown → treat carefully (**retry** or **Needs attention**) |
| On paper change | = **printer healthy again** → auto-retry **failed + waiting** jobs for **that printer** |
| What retries | **Same job / same ticket** — not whole day / all tables |
| Duplicates | Allowed rarely for **one** ticket; **warn** on manual reprint |
| Max auto-retries | Cap + backoff, then **Needs attention** (staff must see it) |
| Client offline | **Refuse** print while Mother offline (no Client-local print). Clear message: retry Send/Print when online. **No** Client pending-flush queue in v1 (optional later) |
| Honest target | Almost never miss; sometimes duplicate one ticket; never silent-lose a whole day — **not** “never miss a print” |

### Explicit non-goals (v1)
- Do **not** auto-reprint all open orders / whole day.
- Do **not** promise 100% paper proof on every cheap ESC/POS printer.
- Do **not** link this track to MTD / VAT / daily-report.
- Do **not** Client→cloud printing.

### Related (already exists — do not remove / build on)
- `NetworkPrintQueueService` + background process
- `OrderRoutingPrintService` / kitchen routing
- `ReceiptService` / customer receipt
- Online order auto-print path
- Label queue (can follow same “ready → retry” idea later; **not** required to lock v1 kitchen/receipt/online)

**Done when:** rules written and agreed ✅ (this doc). Client offline = refuse + staff retry for v1.

## Build order
0. **Phase 0** — lock rules ✅
