## One-line summary

**Code ready:** honest printed · auto-retry last failed when paper/printer ready (kitchen, online, receipt) · staff Print problems · Client refuse offline · DLE where supported.  
**Still need on till:** Phase 6 checklist on real paper so the target is proven, not only coded — *almost never miss; sometimes duplicate one ticket; never silent-lose a whole day.*

## Architecture reminder
Mother owns print hardware + queue. Client never prints locally. Paper change ≈ printer ready → retry **that printer’s** failed jobs only.
